      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi arĩ hamwe na anene a mbũtũ cia ita nĩamũrire ariũ amwe a Asafu, na Hemani, na Jeduthuni marutage wĩra wa ũrathi makĩhũũraga inanda cia mũgeeto, na cia kĩnũbi, na thaani iria ihũũrithanagio ikagamba. Maya nĩmo marĩĩtwa ma andũ arĩa maarutaga wĩra ũyũ wa kũina:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuuma kũrĩ ariũ a Asafu: maarĩ Zakuri, na Jusufu, na Nethania, na Asarela. Ariũ a Asafu maarũgamagĩrĩrwo nĩ Asafu, ũrĩa warathaga ũhoro arũgamĩrĩirwo nĩ mũthamaki.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuuma kũrĩ ariũ a Jeduthuni: maarĩ Gedalia, na Zeri, na Jeshaia, na Shimei, na Hashabia, na Matithia; othe maarĩ atandatũ, marũgamĩrĩirwo nĩ ithe wao Jeduthuni, ũrĩa warathaga ũhoro, akĩhũũraga kĩnanda kĩa mũgeeto, agacookagĩria Jehova ngaatho na akamũgoocaga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuuma kũrĩ ariũ a Hemani: maarĩ Bukia, na Matania, na Uzieli, na Shubaeli, na Jerimothu, na Hanania, na Hanani, na Eliatha, na Gidaliti, na Romamuti-Ezeri, na Joshibekasha, na Malothi, na Hothiru, na Mahaziothu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Acio othe maarĩ ariũ a Hemani ũrĩa wonagĩra mũthamaki maũndũ. Maaheanĩtwo kũrĩ we kũringana na ciĩranĩro cia Ngai nĩguo mamũtũũgagĩrie. Ngai aaheete Hemani ariũ ikũmi na ana, na airĩtu atatũ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Andũ aya othe maarũgamagĩrĩrwo nĩ maithe mao nĩguo mainage thĩinĩ wa hekarũ ya Jehova, marĩ na thaani iria ihũũrithanagio ikagamba, na inanda cia kĩnũbi, na inanda cia mũgeeto, nĩ ũndũ wa ũtungata wa nyũmba ya Ngai. Asafu, na Jeduthuni, na Hemani nao maarũgamagĩrĩrwo nĩ mũthamaki.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hamwe na andũ a nyũmba ciao, arĩa othe maarutĩtwo na makagĩa na ũũgĩ wa kũinĩra Jehova, othe maarĩ andũ 288.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Andũ ethĩ na akũrũ ũndũ ũmwe, na arutani o na arutwo, nĩmacuukire mĩtĩ nĩguo magaĩrwo mawĩra mao.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mũtĩ wa mbere, ũrĩa warĩ wa Asafu, wagwĩrĩire Jusufu, na ariũ ake, na andũ a nyũmba yao, maarĩ andũ 12; wa keerĩ wagwĩrĩire Gedalia, we na andũ a nyũmba yao, na ariũ ao, maarĩ andũ 12;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wa gatatũ wagũĩrĩire Zakuri, na ariũ ake, na andũ a nyũmba yao, maarĩ andũ 12;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wa kana wagũĩrĩire Iziri, na ariũ ake, na andũ a nyũmba yao, maarĩ andũ 12;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wa gatano wagũĩrĩire Nethania, na ariũ ake, na andũ a nyũmba yao, maarĩ andũ 12;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wa gatandatũ wagũĩrĩire Bukia, na ariũ ake, na andũ a nyũmba yao, maarĩ andũ 12;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wa mũgwanja wagũĩrĩire Jesarela, na ariũ ake, na andũ a nyũmba yao, maarĩ andũ 12;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wa kanana wagũĩrĩire Jeshaia, na ariũ ake, na andũ a nyũmba yao, maarĩ andũ 12;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wa kenda wagũĩrĩire Matania, na ariũ ake, na andũ a nyũmba yao, maarĩ andũ 12;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wa ikũmi wagũĩrĩire Shemei, na ariũ ake, na andũ a nyũmba yao, maarĩ andũ 12;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
